#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Edge on Android.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.edgeChooseBody"
msgid "It is in the second row of the menu."
msgstr "Цей пункт у другому ряду меню."

#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Edge on Android, title.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.edgeChooseTitle"
msgid "Choose Add to phone"
msgstr "Виберіть «Додати на телефон»"

#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Edge on Android.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.edgeMenu"
msgid "Tap the three dots at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "Торкніться трьох крапок унизу екрана."

#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Firefox on Android, title.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.firefoxChooseTitle"
msgid "Choose Install"
msgstr "Виберіть «Установити»"

#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Firefox on Android.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.firefoxMenu"
msgid "Tap the three dots in the toolbar."
msgstr "Торкніться трьох крапок на панелі інструментів."

#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Android, title.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.menuTitle"
msgid "Open the browser menu"
msgstr "Відкрийте меню браузера"

#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A step's text. Labels in it (Share, Add to Home Screen, Install app, Add page to, …) are the browser's or OS's own buttons and menu items: use the names they show in this language. Android: an older browser names the menu item differently.
#: client/js/helpers/installGuide.ts
msgctxt "install.android.olderVersions"
msgid "Older versions say Add to Home screen instead."
msgstr "У старіших версіях цей пункт називається «Додати на головний екран»."

